OL,3,GNEWSAFerry to be temporarily taken out
OL,4,Aof service
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Isle of Man's main stand-in
OL,7,Fpassenger ferry is to be temporarily
OL,8,Ftaken out of service for essential
OL,9,Fmaintenance.
OL,11,FThe Ben-my-Chree has been covering the
OL,12,FIsle of Man Steam Packet Company's
OL,13,Fsailings between Douglas and Heysham in
OL,14,FLancashire while the flagship vessel,
OL,15,Fthe Manxman, undergoes significant
OL,16,Frepairs.
OL,18,FHowever, the firm said urgent work was
OL,19,Fneeded on the Ben-my-Chree's stern
OL,20,Fdoor, leaving it out of action on
OL,21,FTuesday morning.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
